<edge source="us_iran_standoff::military_proxy_violence" target="euro_bond_fragment::political_uncertainty_le" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in proxy and military clashes tied to the US–Iran standoff forces European governments into rapid, contested policy choices (sanctions, military posture, refugee/ad hoc energy measures), raising near‑term unpredictability about policymaking and coalition stability.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">euro_bond_fragment</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_iran_standoff::military_proxy_violence" target="russia_ukraine_war::political_pressure" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">High-profile proxy attacks tied to the US–Iran standoff generate government demands and public pressure for private satcom and cloud providers to block or limit services used by hostile actors, creating precedents and bureaucratic momentum that increase frequency and intensity of political requests to operators over their Russia–Ukraine service decisions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_iran_standoff::military_proxy_violence" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::geo_tension_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in US–Iran proxy fighting trigger US escalation and alliance signaling in the wider Indo‑Pacific (surge deployments, joint exercises, sanctions), which directly raise strategic friction and perceived threat levels between the US and China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
