  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Maritime route closures and port disruptions delay or divert shipments of satellite terminals, spare parts and ground-station equipment destined for Ukrainian forces and NGOs, directly reducing usable satcom hardware and thus geographic/time coverage in the theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
