  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising war-risk and liability premiums raise operators' cost and insurers' contractual conditions for servicing high-risk areas, increasing commercial and legal incentives for providers to throttle or condition service to conflict-affected users in the Russia–Ukraine theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
