  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising war‑risk and hull premiums raise transport costs and delivery uncertainty, incentivizing firms to accelerate relocation, diversification of suppliers, or inventory reshoring—increasing the rate at which firms reconfigure supply chains away from exposed routes or partners (including China‑centric setups).</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
