  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased political demands on private operators (e.g., to cut service, divest assets, or comply with sanctions) create immediate legal, contractual and reputational costs that drive client losses and contingency expenses, degrading the financial stability of specialized cloud providers.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
