  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger commercial, legal and security incentives for operators to restrict or avoid serving contested areas leads providers to postpone or cancel planned physical and cloud AI infrastructure rollouts in those markets, reducing the deployment rate.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_infrastructure_risk</data>
</edge>
