  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger commercial, legal and reputational incentives to restrict service (e.g., sanction risk, contract exposure) induce firms to accelerate relocation of production, diversify suppliers, or create alternative corporate entities to reduce operational and compliance exposure.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
