  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter export controls block the flow of satellite components, ground terminals, firmware updates and launch services to actors operating in or supplying the theater, causing immediate reductions in operational coverage and service uptime.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
