  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter export-control regimes increase legal, compliance and commercial risk for providers, directly raising firms' incentives to throttle, suspend or deny services to sanctioned or high‑risk customers to avoid penalties.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
