  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in eurozone sovereign risk premia tightens fiscal and political room for maneuver, making governments less willing to sustain confrontational diplomatic postures over communications services tied to the Russia–Ukraine war and thereby reducing interstate diplomatic friction on those issues.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">euro_bond_fragment</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
