  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising euro-area sovereign risk premia force governments to prioritise domestic fiscal and financial stability, reducing political bandwidth and resources available for cross-border regulatory dialogues and joint institutional initiatives with US and Chinese counterparts, lowering institutional cooperation levels.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">euro_bond_fragment</data>
